## Q4. List and explain the steps involved in publishing a report from Power BI Desktop to Power BI Service in the correct sequence.

1. Sign in to Power BI Desktop using your organizational account  
2. Click **Publish** from the Home ribbon  
3. Select the destination workspace  
4. Power BI uploads the report and dataset  
5. Open Power BI Service to verify the published content  

